ulator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle came in at 48% of normal for January to February and 54% of normal for August to September. Every grid had its driest year in 1958, and grid 28080 was at 67% of normal that year.</p>"}
